id: slot-symlink-dangling
category: slot-symlink
images: rs-oracle10
targets: rhel10
key: kernel.randomize_va_space
xfail_issue: 
comment: 99-sysctl.conf -> ../sysctl.conf is DANGLING (no /etc/sysctl.conf exists): slot_symlink_ok() canonicalize fails -> false (not applied via the etc/sysctl.conf channel), matching the real oracle which silently skips a dangling .conf entry entirely (confirmed: no 'Parsing' line, no error, apply exits 0). Confirming (non-divergent): only 10-real.conf's value applies on both sides.
